{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01355","headline":"相和歌辞 杂怨三首 二 · 孟郊","name":"相和歌辞 杂怨三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫女镜不明，寒花日少容。\n暗蛩有虚织，短线无长缝。\n浪水不可照，狂夫不可从。\n浪水多散影，狂夫多异踪。\n持此一生薄，空成百恨浓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}